22)----------------------WindowAggr: windowExpr=[[rank() PARTITION BY [store.s_state] ORDER BY [sum(store_sales.ss_net_profit) DESC NULLS FIRST] RANGE BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW]]
